        "details": "Partial Binance Futures data gaps were caused by an internal rate-limit handling issue. After a WebSocket disconnect, REST requests for initial order book snapshots hit temporary Binance IP bans, causing repeated reconnects and missing real-time and generated REST data. Most channels progressively recovered between 12:58 and 13:00 UTC, and 13:01 UTC is the first complete minute. Open interest remained incomplete during recovery and was completely absent from 12:59 through 14:09 UTC. Normal open-interest recording resumed at 2026-07-14T14:10:47 UTC, with 14:11 UTC as its first complete minute. Request retry and rate-limit handling was corrected."
      },
